  - “I think …”, “possibly …”, “might be …”, “around baseline”, “should …”, “waiting for …”
  - “final time hasn’t been confirmed yet” (this is about confirmation/scheduling status, not the speaker explicitly lacking knowledge)
  - Statements about someone else being unsure (e.g., “she wasn’t sure what time yet”) unless the task explicitly wants the current speaker’s unknown; default: exclude these.

