- Each extracted unknown-fact statement must be returned as a separate item.
- Do not merge or stitch together text from different parts of the transcript.
- Quotes must match the source text exactly (character-for-character; keep punctuation/typography as-is; no corrections).
- Keep quote boundaries tight: include only the minimal span that contains the explicit unknown knowledge statement (avoid extra context before/after).
- Label every extracted item exactly as: "Unknown fact".
- If there are no explicit unknown-fact statements, return an empty list.

Output format:
- Return a JSON list of objects like:
  [{"label":"Unknown fact","quote":"..."}]
- If none, return: []
